  "abstract": "Run and operate NVIDIA NIM for LLMs and VLMs, the prebuilt vLLM or SGLang containers from nvcr.io/nim. Covers model-specific and model-free images, model profiles and list-model-profiles, NIM_* variables, tool calling, LoRA, speculative decoding, Docker, the nim-llm Helm chart and the NIM Operator, air-gapped caches, multi-node Ray, the OpenAI, Responses and Anthropic APIs, metrics and tracing, upgrades and error fixes. Verified against NIM LLM 2.0.13.",
